  "details": "This involves using the search button that's within the Group, Social or Worlds tabs, and not the search icon on the top by the bell.\n\n1. Launch the game.\n\n2. Open up menu and go to Worlds, Social, or Groups tab.\n\n3. Click the search button that's exclusive to that page.\n\n• \"Search Worlds\" button in the World tab\n\n• \"User Search\" button in the Social tab\n\n• \"Find a Group\" button in the Groups tab\n\n4. Search for anything.\n\n5. Observe nothing happen.",
